        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“The 3D renderings were incredible — we could see exactly what our Wallingford kitchen would look like before any work began. The designer identified that we could fit a 9-foot island by relocating the pantry.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Samantha D.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">1 month ago</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“They redesigned our cramped Queen Anne galley kitchen into an open L-shape with island. The structural engineering for the load-bearing wall removal was included in the design package.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Paul M.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">3 months ago</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“Used their design service for our Kirkland townhouse kitchen and took the plans to another contractor. The construction drawings were detailed enough that the builder had zero questions.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Lisa J.</p>
